Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.99,0:00:04.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們從打撈到的聖遺物中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.38,0:00:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挑出可能是武器的東西集中了起來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是寶…寶山啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.36,0:00:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修復這些東西便是你神聖的職責
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.50,0:00:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說得倒簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是一點頭緒都沒有 我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.84,0:00:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.97,0:00:23.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 能透視內部嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這也太厲害了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:34.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能用於強化武裝的物品 你可以隨意處置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:35.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.88,0:00:39.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好 包在我身上了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:42.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼 之後就交給你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.89,0:00:52.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這東西還真…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:54.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,廉價的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:56.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說了啥？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.25,0:00:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說你是廉價的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到別人賜予的東西就滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.21,0:01:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我還以為你會是個稍微有骨氣的男人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.95,0:01:08.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你幹嘛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.37,0:01:10.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底想說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.05,0:01:12.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個會飛的人型機器人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,破廢鐵怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能幫我個忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.51,0:01:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓我用用它麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.97,0:01:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不懂你的意思呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.95,0:01:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其實我已經受夠這艦團的做法了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:27.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回頭當海賊去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.51,0:01:34.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個艦團嘛 就讓它沉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.03,0:01:35.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中校
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.02,0:01:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以終止對加爾剛蒂亞的攻擊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:56.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.89,0:02:00.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果想幫助他們
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:03.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是應該盡快對他們進行啟蒙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為了擴大人類繁榮的版圖 我們需要優秀的人才和資源
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.95,0:02:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.42,0:02:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雷德 將新的秩序帶給這個星球是我們的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.07,0:02:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣與銀河同盟有什麼區別…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果無法復歸戰線
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.43,0:02:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就要將這個地球打造成我等的理想鄉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:27.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二個阿瓦隆
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.22,0:02:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我等的正義不變
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別猶豫
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:36.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,OP
Comment: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Episode.12 title
